stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_valid_sidecar: REJECT if not verify_data_column_sidecar(sidecar)
    q_valid_sidecar --> q_reject_invalid: sidecar invalid / REJECT
    q_valid_sidecar --> q_check_subnet: sidecar valid
    q_check_subnet --> q_reject_subnet: wrong subnet / REJECT
    q_check_subnet --> q_check_future: compute_subnet matches subnet_id
    q_check_future --> q_ignore_future: slot > current_slot + disparity / IGNORE
    q_check_future --> q_check_finalized: slot <= current_slot
    q_check_finalized --> q_ignore_finalized: slot <= finalized_start_slot / IGNORE
    q_check_finalized --> q_check_proposer_sig: slot > finalized_start_slot
    q_check_proposer_sig --> q_reject_sig: invalid proposer signature / REJECT
    q_check_proposer_sig --> q_check_parent_seen: valid proposer signature
    q_check_parent_seen --> q_ignore_parent: parent not seen / IGNORE
    q_check_parent_seen --> q_check_parent_valid: parent seen
    q_check_parent_valid --> q_reject_parent: parent invalid / REJECT
    q_check_parent_valid --> q_check_higher_slot: parent valid
    q_check_higher_slot --> q_reject_slot: slot <= parent slot / REJECT
    q_check_higher_slot --> q_check_finalized_ancestor: slot > parent slot
    q_check_finalized_ancestor --> q_reject_ancestor: not ancestor of finalized / REJECT
    q_check_finalized_ancestor --> q_check_inclusion: is ancestor of finalized
    q_check_inclusion --> q_reject_inclusion: inclusion proof invalid / REJECT
    q_check_inclusion --> q_check_kzg: verify_data_column_sidecar_inclusion_proof passes
    q_check_kzg --> q_reject_kzg: kzg proofs invalid / REJECT
    q_check_kzg --> q_check_duplicate: verify_data_column_sidecar_kzg_proofs passes
    q_check_duplicate --> q_ignore_dup: duplicate (slot, proposer, index) / IGNORE
    q_check_duplicate --> q_check_expected_proposer: first sidecar for tuple
    q_check_expected_proposer --> q_reject_proposer: wrong proposer for slot / REJECT
    q_check_expected_proposer --> [*]: expected proposer / ACCEPT
    q_reject_invalid --> [*]
    q_reject_subnet --> [*]
    q_ignore_future --> [*]
    q_ignore_finalized --> [*]
    q_reject_sig --> [*]
    q_ignore_parent --> [*]
    q_reject_parent --> [*]
    q_reject_slot --> [*]
    q_reject_ancestor --> [*]
    q_reject_inclusion --> [*]
    q_reject_kzg --> [*]
    q_ignore_dup --> [*]
    q_reject_proposer --> [*]
